        "bhavartha": "The closing stanza names the hymn and the one who sang it. These eight verses in praise of Rudra were spoken by the brāhmaṇa, to win the favour of Hara. Then it says what follows for those who take up the hymn: when people recite it with devotion, Śambhu is pleased with them."
      },
